        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As indicated in partner agreements, we are able to sell CCBX loans back to the originating partner as one method of managing CCBX portfolio and partner limits.",
        "start_character": 34415,
        "end_character": 34574
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437958-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437958-26-000013-375579355a47e6b9",
        "accession_number": "0001437958-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Developing the kind of unique offerings to specific under-served or under-banked populations would be difficult for a bank our size, but through our CCBX partnerships we are able to use our banking charter to support this effort in a much broader scope.",
        "start_character": 4197,
        "end_character": 4450
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437958-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437958-26-000013-375579355a47e6b9",
        "accession_number": "0001437958-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer business accounts and cash management services, including business checking and savings accounts, and treasury services.",
        "start_character": 35100,
        "end_character": 35234
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437958-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437958-26-000013-375579355a47e6b9",
        "accession_number": "0001437958-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide a wide range of deposit services, including debit cards, remote deposit capture, online banking, mobile banking, and direct deposit services.",
        "start_character": 34942,
        "end_character": 35099
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437958-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437958-26-000013-375579355a47e6b9",
        "accession_number": "0001437958-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We currently operate 14 full-service banking locations, 12 of which are located in Snohomish County, where we are the largest community bank by deposit market share, and two of which are located in neighboring counties (one in King County and one in Island County).",
        "start_character": 1370,
        "end_character": 1635
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437958-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437958-26-000013-375579355a47e6b9",
        "accession_number": "0001437958-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed tailored underwriting criteria and credit management processes and procedures for each of the various loan product types we offer our customers.",
        "start_character": 22859,
        "end_character": 23021
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437958-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437958-26-000013-375579355a47e6b9",
        "accession_number": "0001437958-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we had $222.1 million in construction, land and land development loans, representing 5.9% of total loans.",
        "start_character": 13863,
        "end_character": 13993
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437958-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437958-26-000013-375579355a47e6b9",
        "accession_number": "0001437958-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Since we own all of the capital stock of the Bank, we are a bank holding company under the Bank Holding Company Act of 1956, as amended (the “BHC Act”).",
        "start_character": 56497,
        "end_character": 56649
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437958-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437958-26-000013-375579355a47e6b9",
        "accession_number": "0001437958-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are primarily holding the majority of our on-balance sheet liquidity in interest bearing bank deposits to limit our exposure to interest rate and price risk and to provide readily available funds for loan growth.",
        "start_character": 38319,
        "end_character": 38534
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437958-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437958-26-000013-375579355a47e6b9",
        "accession_number": "0001437958-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We make loans to established builders to construct residential properties, to developers of commercial real estate investment properties and residential developments and, to a lesser extent, loans to individual clients for construction of single family homes in our market areas.",
